org.machanism.macha.core.adapters.spring.web:order-controller 0.0.4 发布, Core Spring Boot Order Controllers is a project that exposes order management workflows as RESTful APIs 
		using Spring Boot. It bridges Core order logic with external systems, ensuring modularity, scalability, 
		and alignment with Clean Architecture principles.

